<title>BRAZIL: Telesp, Telerj nine-month earnings.</title>
<headline>Telesp, Telerj nine-month earnings.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telesp, unit of federally owned Telebras serving Sao Paulo state, said it reported a net profit of 566.119 million reais in the January-to-September period.</p>
<p>Telerj, unit of Telebras serving Rio de Janeiro state, said it had a net profit of 55.289 million reais in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>The results were sent to the stock exchanges earlier.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
